<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6715" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακλαίω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακῑν-κλάω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κλαύσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Telecl.
					1
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>:—<i>weep aloud, burst into tears,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακλαύσας μέγα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.14
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				18.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>weep for,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακὰ μέζω ἢ ὥστε ἀνακλαίειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.14
				</span></i>
			: so in 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμῖν τάδ᾽ . . ἀνακλαίομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					939
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς παρούσας ἀτυχίας ἀνακλαύσασθαι
					πρὸς ὑμᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					2.4.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
